    "message": "Replace dplyr::as_tibble with as.data.frame for Hits objects + add diagnostics\n\n- Replace dplyr::as_tibble(hits) with as.data.frame(hits) for S4 Hits objects\n  to fix potential S4Vectors compatibility issue in newer Bioconductor\n- Add diagnostic output in vignette to show RT class/structure after rtDetect\n- Add NULL check in vignette before using RT$SKA3 to prevent crash and\n  provide informative error message\n- Bump version to 1.17.4\n",
    "time": 1770690432
